Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.21,0:19:59.38,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,CRING
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.99,0:21:02.25,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,NYAM
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.29,0:21:21.73,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,"RUMAH MAKAN KOTOBUKI"
